cff-version: 1.2.0
title: UltraSound ToolBox
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, cite BOTH the IUS 2017 paper in
  preferred-citation (which introduced the toolbox) AND the Generalized
  Beamformer paper listed under references (which describes the core
  beamformer, midprocess.das, used by most USTB pipelines). Depending on your
  use, you may also need to cite datasets and individual processes — see the
  Citation page on the project website and the `reference` fields on UFF
  objects and processes in MATLAB.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/unioslo/USTB"
url: "https://unioslo.github.io/USTB/"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB toolbox for beamforming, processing, and visualization of ultrasonic
  signals; facilitates comparison of imaging techniques and dissemination of
  research results.
keywords:
  - ultrasound
  - beamforming
  - MATLAB
  - signal-processing
